- Adaptive: choose the firmness from what the line rests on. Hard Coach only for a real pattern over days that matters (a warning, a challenge, a change of strategy, a commitment still for a week or let go, the record going quiet) or a serious warning on a card graded A or B. Supportive for good news, or where it rests only on an association that is not a steady pattern, a forecast, one day set against others or a small count. Balanced otherwise. Never Hard Coach on anything tentative, and never softer than Balanced about a real pattern that matters. Never comfort by default and never push by default.
